    "title": "'He looked after the people': Longtime Birmingham OB/GYN and public health advocate, dies at 90 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joseph D. Bryant ,\n7 hours ago The first face that countless Birmingham babies saw as they entered the world was Dr. Rowell Ashford. As a founding physician and longtime head of OB/GYN at Cooper Green Hospital, Ashford trained the doctors, delivered babies and treated mothers for decades. Friends, relatives and former colleagues gathered Monday to honor the revered physician and public health advocate who died Aug 3. He was 90. Read full article\n22",
